          "source": "schematic",
          "quote": "FCC Peripherals sheet, U11 PCA9685PW: pin 1 A0 connected to +3.3V, pins 2-5/24 connected to GND, note 'I2C address: 0x41'"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "If the firmware or intended design expects the PCA9685 at address 0x40, it will not communicate with the PWM driver, causing servo/PWM outputs to remain uncontrolled or uninitialized.",
      "confidence": 0.66
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The schematic otherwise matches the specification, including the known barometer reset/EOC pin swap, but the PCA9685 PWM driver address strap is set to 0x41 while the specification intends 0x40, which is a clear deviation from the intended design."
